Interpreted version
===================

elan unification simplesig

elan unificationC simplesig


Compiled version
================

elanc unification simplesig ; gmake --file unification.make ; a.out

elanc unificationC simplesig ; gmake --file unificationC.make ; a.out


Equations
=========

f(z,u)=f(a,w) /\ f(w,z) = f(g(c),v) end

g(v) = g(c) /\ z=g(g(a)) /\ w=g(z) end

v = a /\ w = z /\ z = b /\ v=w end

